    <h2>From review to direct research</h2>
    <p><strong>Published pathway:</strong> our accepted review examines oral hydration physiology, formulation and opportunities for future innovation. It supports discussion of the literature, not a Best Hydrate-specific efficacy claim.</p>
    <p><strong>Study development:</strong> the next phase is focused on designing practical hydration research with appropriate measurements, controls and feasibility. Protocol details will be shared when they are ready for public disclosure.</p>
  </article>
